<RadzenCard>
    <RadzenStack Gap="0.75rem">
        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H6">
            PayChangu API key not configured
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            The sample application has started, but the PayChangu API examples are unavailable
            until you configure your API secret key. Use .NET User Secrets to keep your key
            out of source control.
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            Follow these steps to configure your API key:
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            <strong>1. Open a terminal</strong>
            Open PowerShell, Command Prompt, or your preferred terminal.
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            <strong>2. Navigate to the sample project directory</strong>
            From the repository's root directory, run:
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenAlert AlertStyle="AlertStyle.Dark"
                     ShowIcon="false"
                     AllowClose="false"
                     Variant="Variant.Flat"
                     Style="background-color: #1e1e1e; color: #ffffff; border-color: #1e1e1e;">
            <pre style="margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; color: inherit;"><code style="color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;">cd PayChangu.NET.BlazorSample</code></pre>
        </RadzenAlert>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            <strong>3. Configure your PayChangu API secret key</strong>
            Run the following command from the sample project directory, replacing the placeholder
            with your actual PayChangu secret key:
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenAlert AlertStyle="AlertStyle.Dark"
                     ShowIcon="false"
                     AllowClose="false"
                     Variant="Variant.Flat"
                     Style="background-color: #1e1e1e; color: #ffffff; border-color: #1e1e1e;">
            <pre style="margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; color: inherit;"><code style="color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;">dotnet user-secrets set "PayChangu:SecretKey" "&lt;your-paychangu-secret-key&gt;"</code></pre>
        </RadzenAlert>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            <strong>4. Start or restart the sample application</strong>
            If the application is already running, stop it first. Then run:
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenAlert AlertStyle="AlertStyle.Dark"
                     ShowIcon="false"
                     AllowClose="false"
                     Variant="Variant.Flat"
                     Style="background-color: #1e1e1e; color: #ffffff; border-color: #1e1e1e;">
            <pre style="margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; color: inherit;"><code style="color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;">dotnet run</code></pre>
        </RadzenAlert>

        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
            Once the application restarts, this notice will disappear and the PayChangu API
            examples will become available.
        </RadzenText>

        <RadzenAlert AlertStyle="AlertStyle.Warning"
                     ShowIcon="true"
                     AllowClose="false">
            Never commit your PayChangu secret key to source control or share it publicly.
        </RadzenAlert>
    </RadzenStack>
</RadzenCard>